<title>USA: Cox Radio Q1 shr $1.21 vs $0.09.</title>
<headline>Cox Radio Q1 shr $1.21 vs $0.09.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.21		    $0.9</p>
<p> Net		 .0934,203		1,812</p>
<p> Revs		29,155		   29,568</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  28,315		   19,578</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Notes: The company said net income for the first quarter of 1997 includes a $30.1 million, or $1.07 per share, after-tax gain on the sale of WCKG-FM and WYSY-FM in Chicago.</p>
<p>Weighted shares figures assumes the company's recapitalization and the related issuance of 19,577,672 of class B common occurred on January 1, 1996. Also reflects the issuance of 8,736,973 shares of Class A common.</p>
